{"parse": {"title": "Prison Pete", "pageid": 24449, "revid": 15320450, "redirects": [], "wikitext": {"*": "{{External|rs}}\n{{Infobox NPC\n|name = Prison Pete\n|image = [[File:Prison Pete.png|120px]]\n|release = [[10 January]] [[2006]]\n|update = The Hand in the Sand\n|members = No\n|race = [[Human]]\n|location = [[ScapeRune]]\n|gender = Male\n|options = Talk-to\n|examine = He wants to escape!\n|map = {{Map|x=2093|y=4466|plane=0|zoom=3|mtype=pin|mapID=10127}}\n|dropversion = Free-to-play,Members\n|id = 368\n|leagueRegion = general\n}}\n[[File:Prison Pete chathead.png|left]]\n'''Prison Pete''' is found in the Prison [[random event]] in [[ScapeRune]]. To escape, players must locate [[Balloon Animal|balloon animals]] that resemble the one shown to them when they pull the lever on the wall. The player receives a [[Prison key (Prison Pete)|prison key]] in their inventory after popping a balloon animal. The player must give him three correct keys in a row to leave the cell and escape to freedom. Logging out resets the random event's progress.\n\nHe appears to be the ScapeRune version of [[Party Pete]].\n{{Listen\n|title = [[Freedom at Last! (Prison Pete)|Freedom at Last!]]\n|align = right\n|filename = Freedom at Last! (Prison Pete).ogg\n|desc = The jingle that plays upon walking out of the prison.}}\n{{Listen\n|title = [[Wrong Key! (Prison Pete)|Wrong Key]]\n|align = right\n|filename = Wrong Key! (Prison Pete).ogg\n|desc = The jingle that plays upon using the wrong key on a door.}}\n==Strategy==\nYou do not have to close the image before clicking on a balloon animal, which may be easier than trying to memorize the image.\n\nIf memorizing the image, however, it may be easier to remember each part of the balloon animal separately:\n* Head: antlers, ears (one section), or ears (two sections)\n* Body: thick or thin\n* Tail: long (one section), long (two sections), or short\n\nThe varying characteristics between each balloon animal can be easily distinguished from their horns, body width, and tail length.\n\n<gallery position=\"center\" widths=\"100px\">\nBalloon Animal (cat).png|Cat\nBalloon Animal (dog).png|Dog\nBalloon Animal (goat).png|Goat\nBalloon Animal (sheep).png|Sheep\n</gallery>\n\n==Rewards==\nThe event can be left before completion by talking with Prison Pete, but this grants no rewards.\n<!-- {{Average drop value|mobname=Prison Pete|killname=event reward}} -->\n===Free-to-play rewards===\n{{DropLogProject|kills=754}}\n{{DropsTableHead|dropversion=Free-to-play}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Lamp|quantity=1|rarity=306/754|approx=yes|raritynotes={{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1694663234802929806|date=24 August 2023|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/108428|archivedate=25 August 2023|quote=It replaces the \"500 coins\" rewards that they previously gave|name=coinstolamp}}|gemw=no}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Uncut ruby|quantity=4 (noted)|rarity=108/754|approx=yes}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Uncut diamond|quantity=3 (noted)|rarity=100/754|approx=yes}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Chaos rune|quantity=19-25|rarity=110/754|approx=yes}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Law rune|quantity=7-10|rarity=134/754|approx=yes}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Members rewards===\n{{DropLogProject|kills=5656}}\n{{DropsTableHead|dropversion=Members}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Lamp|quantity=1|rarity=1194/5656|approx=yes|raritynotes={{NamedRef|name=coinstolamp}}|gemw=no}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Uncut ruby|quantity=4 (noted)|rarity=580/5656|approx=yes}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Uncut diamond|quantity=3 (noted)|rarity=631/5656|approx=yes}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Mithril arrowtips|namenotes={{(m)}}|quantity=45-50|rarity=49/5656|approx=yes}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Ugthanki kebab|namenotes={{(m)}}|quantity=2|rarity=65/5656|approx=yes}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Chaos rune|quantity=19-25|rarity=569/5656|approx=yes}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Law rune|quantity=7-10|rarity=555/5656|approx=yes}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Grimy toadflax|namenotes={{(m)}}|quantity=6 (noted)|rarity=1225/5656|approx=yes}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Grimy snapdragon|namenotes={{(m)}}|quantity=4 (noted)|rarity=7/50|raritynotes={{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1695369663260078377|date=26 August 2023|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/101248|archivedate=3 October 2023|quote=[(...) Could you have a look at specifically Snapdragons?] 7/50}}}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n==Dialogue==\n{{hastranscript|npc}}\n\n==Gallery==\n<gallery>\nScapeRune Prison.png|ScapeRune Prison Room with Prison Pete and Balloon Animals.\nScapeRune Prison balloon target.png|The current balloon which has the key.\n</gallery>\n\n==Changes==\n{{Subject changes header}}\n{{Subject changes\n|date = 8 November 2018\n|update = The Portal Nexus\n|change = The random event can now be left early by talking to the NPC.\n}}\n{{Subject changes\n|date = 25 April 2013\n|update = Patch Notes (25 April 2013)\n|change = Prison Pete's balloons have been enlarged, making them easier to identify.\n}}\n{{Subject changes footer}}\n\n==Trivia==\n* ScapeRune is a facsimile of the [[Falador Party Room]] and the surrounding area of eastern [[Falador]].\n* When the Party Room was located in [[Seers' Village]], ScapeRune was a facsimile of the building and its surrounding area.\n* Dying in this random event, by dealing damage to yourself, will cause you to respawn inside the event with the text {{mes|The power of this special place protects your possessions.}} appearing in the chatbox.\n* It is possible to make Pete angry by littering in the exit hallway. To do this, players must first drop an item on the floor while completing the event. Then, when leaving the event, click to stay when prompted to pick up items. After that, players can attempt to drop an item in the exit hallway, prompting Pete to get angry at the player.\n* Trying to cast a spell such as [[High Level Alchemy]] in the random event will yield the message {{mes|You didn't come here to do that!}}\n* The \"return key\" option, the default action for the key, walks directly toward Prison Pete, with no attempt to navigate around obstructions.\n\n==References==\n{{Reflist}}\n\n{{Random events}}\n{{Pete Family}}"}}, "fetchedAt": "2026-10-06T04:21:14.125545+00:00", "dropHtml": "<table class=\"wikitable sortable filterable item-drops autosort=4,a\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"border-right: none;\" class=\"drops-img-header drop-disp-btn unsortable\" title=\"Sort items by category, rarity and name.\"></th>\n<th style=\"border-left: none;\" class=\"item-col\">Item</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">Quantity</th>\n<th>Rarity</th>\n<th class=\"ge-column\" data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th>\n<th class=\"alch-column\" data-sort-type=\"number\">High Alch</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td class=\"inventory-image\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Lamp\" title=\"Lamp\"><img alt=\"Lamp.png: Prison Pete drops Lamp with rarity 306/754 in quantity 1\" src=\"/images/Lamp.png?fa8bd\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"29\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"29\" data-file-height=\"13\" /></a></span></td><td class=\"item-col\" style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"/w/Lamp\" title=\"Lamp\">Lamp</a></td><td data-sort-value=\"1\">1</td><td data-sort-value=\"2.4640522875817\" class=\"table-bg-green\" title=\"~40.6%\"><span data-drop-percent=\"~40.6\" data-drop-permil=\"~406\" data-drop-fraction=\"~306/754\" data-drop-permyriad=\"~4058\" data-drop-oneover=\"~1/2.464\">~306/754</span><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-coinstolamp&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-coinstolamp-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></td><td data-sort-value=\"0\" class=\"ge-column table-na\" title=\"This item cannot be traded on the Grand Exchange.\" style=\"text-align:right;cursor:help;text-decoration:underline dotted\">Not sol